     1,
     "<div>To all that are interested,</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ll be giving a talk on &quot;Habitat-Informed Home-Range Estimation&quot; in \r\nthe Spatial Ecology and Modeling: Habitat Selection II session on \r\n<b>Tuesday, November 08, 2022 </b>from <b>1:30 PM - 1:45 PM</b> in <b>SCC - Ballroom 111C</b>.</div><div>This will cover the RSF-informed kernel density estimation now available in <span style=\"font-family:Courier New\">ctmm</span>.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Chris<br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
